WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.628
The certified-partner stamp! Just one press and you're official.

00:00:05.628 --> 00:00:10.005
How many brains does this one come with?

00:00:10.005 --> 00:00:14.015
The AI, well, that one runs on our side, so to speak…

00:00:14.015 --> 00:00:19.518
So. The certification doesn't include the AI.

00:00:19.518 --> 00:00:21.769
…It does not.

00:00:21.769 --> 00:00:24.020
So it's just a pass.

00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:32.322
We hold zero certificates. Our AI sleeps behind our own wall.

